[Pixself](https://pixself.studio/) was a **13-week university group project** to build and run a small business. That period included preparation, prelaunch, about one month of selling and the work after sales stopped. The team sold customizable pixel-character keychains and completed **150 orders in the first two weeks of sales**.

I led the product and website work, directly ran Meta Ads and later added order-processing automation. Product development and the visual system were shared with the team; the sales results below are team results.
